Package: eld
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 python3:any,
 python3-yaml,
Description: LLVM-based embedded ELF linker
 ELD is an ELF linker for embedded software projects. It aims to be compatible
 with the GNU linker while providing a smaller memory footprint, fast link
 times, detailed map files, and a plugin API.
 .
 This build uses Ubuntu's LLVM 22 libraries and supports Hexagon, AArch64, ARM,
 RISC-V, and x86-64 targets.

Package: liblw4
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: ELD linker wrapper runtime library
 This package provides the shared linker wrapper used by ELD and by ELD
 plugins at run time.

Package: eld-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 liblw4 (= ${binary:Version}),
 llvm-22-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: development files for ELD linker plugins
 This package provides the ELD plugin API headers and the unversioned linker
 wrapper library needed to build plugins for ELD 22.
